WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.201
Palestinian officials call

00:00:01.201 --> 00:00:02.002
it madness

00:00:02.002 --> 00:00:04.471
that could inflame the entire region.

00:00:04.471 --> 00:00:05.238
But Israelis

00:00:05.238 --> 00:00:07.374
who took part in a controversial march

00:00:07.374 --> 00:00:08.808
say it's just the beginning

00:00:08.808 --> 00:00:10.110
of retaking land

00:00:10.110 --> 00:00:11.745
they believe belongs to them.

00:00:11.745 --> 00:00:14.047
Thousands of settlers marched

00:00:14.414 --> 00:00:16.082
to an evacuated outpost

00:00:16.082 --> 00:00:17.951
in the occupied West Bank today.

00:00:17.951 --> 00:00:18.485
As you can see,

00:00:18.485 --> 00:00:20.453
they're under the heavy protection

00:00:20.453 --> 00:00:22.889
of soldiers to far right.

00:00:22.922 --> 00:00:23.890
Israeli ministers

00:00:23.890 --> 00:00:25.392
and some parliament members

00:00:25.392 --> 00:00:26.493
were among them

00:00:26.493 --> 00:00:29.062
protesting their own government's policy

00:00:29.329 --> 00:00:32.132
that considers the outpost illegal.

00:00:32.465 --> 00:00:33.333
Palestinians

00:00:33.333 --> 00:00:35.702
in a nearby village protested the march,

00:00:35.702 --> 00:00:37.771
some clashing with Israeli forces.

00:00:38.071 --> 00:00:40.974
The Palestinian red Crescent says 216

00:00:41.007 --> 00:00:42.242
people were injured,

00:00:42.242 --> 00:00:44.444
some by rubber bullets.

00:00:44.444 --> 00:00:45.812
Elsewhere in the West

00:00:45.812 --> 00:00:48.481
Bank, mourners buried a 15 year old

00:00:48.481 --> 00:00:49.482
Palestinian boy

00:00:49.482 --> 00:00:51.151
killed by Israeli soldiers

00:00:51.151 --> 00:00:53.219
in a refugee camp near Jericho.

00:00:53.553 --> 00:00:55.755
Israel says its forces came under attack

00:00:55.755 --> 00:00:57.690
during a raid to arrest a tourist,

00:00:57.690 --> 00:00:59.059
a terror suspect.

00:00:59.059 --> 00:01:00.093
So they responded,

00:01:00.093 --> 00:01:02.462
they say, with live fire.

00:01:02.829 --> 00:01:04.330
I want to bring in our correspondent

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:05.031
Frederik Pleitgen

00:01:05.031 --> 00:01:05.899
is following developments

00:01:05.899 --> 00:01:08.101
tonight for us from Jerusalem. Fred.

00:01:08.301 --> 00:01:09.302
Good to see you. This evening.

00:01:09.302 --> 00:01:10.637
So we've heard, I believe,

00:01:10.637 --> 00:01:12.572
from the Israeli prime minister, Benjamin

00:01:12.572 --> 00:01:13.540
Netanyahu in the last,

00:01:13.540 --> 00:01:16.042
what, 20 minutes or so. What did he say

00:01:18.044 --> 00:01:18.211
Well,

00:01:18.211 --> 00:01:18.912
you say he certainly didn't

00:01:18.912 --> 00:01:20.380
sound like he was going to back down

00:01:20.380 --> 00:01:21.281
or make any concessions.

00:01:21.281 --> 00:01:21.614
In fact,

00:01:21.614 --> 00:01:22.482
he opened his speech

00:01:22.482 --> 00:01:23.083
that he gave tonight,

00:01:23.083 --> 00:01:23.783
which you're absolutely right.

00:01:23.783 --> 00:01:25.285
Ended just a couple of minutes ago

00:01:25.285 --> 00:01:26.486
saying that Israel was,

00:01:26.486 --> 00:01:28.988
as he put it, under a terror attack.

00:01:28.988 --> 00:01:30.056
And then he outlined

00:01:30.056 --> 00:01:30.457
some of the

00:01:30.457 --> 00:01:31.858
what he called very tough measures

00:01:31.858 --> 00:01:32.992
that the Israeli government

00:01:32.992 --> 00:01:34.494
has taken in the past couple of days,

00:01:34.494 --> 00:01:35.528
saying, for instance,

00:01:35.528 --> 00:01:37.063
that they hit both Hezbollah

00:01:37.063 --> 00:01:38.798
and Hamas targets

00:01:38.798 --> 00:01:39.399
last week

00:01:39.399 --> 00:01:41.201
and, of course, over the weekend as well.

00:01:41.201 --> 00:01:41.801
Then having hit

00:01:41.801 --> 00:01:43.336
Hezbollah targets is certainly something

00:01:43.336 --> 00:01:44.437
new that the Israelis

00:01:44.437 --> 00:01:45.972
so far hadn't said before.

00:01:45.972 --> 00:01:46.806
What he also did is

00:01:46.806 --> 00:01:48.041
he took a couple of jibes

00:01:48.041 --> 00:01:49.542
at the predecessor government

00:01:49.542 --> 00:01:51.211
and in fact, Naftali Bennett,

00:01:51.211 --> 00:01:52.278
who headed that government,

00:01:52.278 --> 00:01:54.080
he has already tweeted, calling

00:01:54.080 --> 00:01:56.015
Netanyahu's speech disgraceful.

00:01:56.015 --> 00:01:57.650
But you are also absolutely right.

00:01:57.650 --> 00:01:58.351
You thought

00:01:58.351 --> 00:01:59.185
that all of this comes

00:01:59.185 --> 00:02:01.321
in an extremely charged atmosphere.

00:02:01.321 --> 00:02:01.921
And, you know,

00:02:01.955 --> 00:02:03.123
we were at that march

00:02:03.123 --> 00:02:05.325
that took place today by those settlers.

00:02:05.458 --> 00:02:06.259
And here's what we witnessed

00:02:07.560 --> 00:02:08.328
amid an already

00:02:08.328 --> 00:02:10.296
highly charged atmosphere.

00:02:10.296 --> 00:02:12.031
Thousands of Israeli settlers

00:02:12.031 --> 00:02:13.399
marched in the West Bank

00:02:13.399 --> 00:02:16.236
to an abandoned settlement called Evitar

00:02:16.369 --> 00:02:18.338
demanding to open it back up,

00:02:18.338 --> 00:02:19.939
ready to fight for it.

00:02:19.939 --> 00:02:22.675
If it need to be with our enemy.

00:02:23.243 --> 00:02:25.345
And it will be our government,

00:02:25.345 --> 00:02:27.347
because nobody

00:02:27.347 --> 00:02:29.449
will disconnected from this land

00:02:31.451 --> 00:02:32.919
Avatar is classified

00:02:32.919 --> 00:02:34.354
as an illegal outpost

00:02:34.354 --> 00:02:35.755
by Israel's government

00:02:35.755 --> 00:02:38.324
built on land Palestinians say they own.

00:02:38.725 --> 00:02:39.859
But now even members

00:02:39.859 --> 00:02:40.894
of Benjamin Netanyahu's

00:02:40.894 --> 00:02:42.395
cabinet are marching here

00:02:42.395 --> 00:02:43.329
like the far right

00:02:43.329 --> 00:02:44.864
national security minister

00:02:44.864 --> 00:02:47.000
who we met with me,

00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:47.700
Sir Hassan,

00:02:47.700 --> 00:02:48.601
who is strong in

00:02:48.601 --> 00:02:50.470
Avatar, will be strong in Tel Aviv.

00:02:50.470 --> 00:02:51.271
He told us.

00:02:51.271 --> 00:02:52.639
We won't give in to terror.

00:02:52.639 --> 00:02:54.941
Not an Avatar, not in Tel Aviv.

00:02:56.042 --> 00:02:57.143
The really large turnout here

00:02:57.143 --> 00:02:58.077
at this demonstration

00:02:58.077 --> 00:02:59.512
and the folks who came here,

00:02:59.512 --> 00:03:01.214
they do feel that there is a government

00:03:01.214 --> 00:03:02.482
in power in this country

00:03:02.482 --> 00:03:03.349
now that's more

00:03:03.349 --> 00:03:05.318
sympathetic to their demands

00:03:05.318 --> 00:03:06.553
and they demand

00:03:06.553 --> 00:03:07.620
that they be allowed

00:03:07.620 --> 00:03:09.722
to have more settlements in this area.

00:03:10.356 --> 00:03:11.991
Even though we have many, many Arab

00:03:13.092 --> 00:03:14.127
settlements over here.

00:03:14.127 --> 00:03:17.130
But this area is the land of the Bible.

00:03:17.564 --> 00:03:19.065
Okay, we'll be here.

00:03:19.065 --> 00:03:21.734
Abraham Isaac and Yaakov

00:03:22.335 --> 00:03:24.037
went and walked in this area.

00:03:24.037 --> 00:03:24.704
So we want

00:03:24.704 --> 00:03:28.141
we're just a continuation of them.

00:03:28.141 --> 00:03:30.410
But the violence continues to spiral.

00:03:31.444 --> 00:03:33.646
The current crisis started when Israeli

00:03:33.646 --> 00:03:34.547
security forces

00:03:34.547 --> 00:03:36.182
raided the Al-Aqsa Mosque

00:03:36.182 --> 00:03:37.250
in Jerusalem twice

00:03:37.250 --> 00:03:39.586
last week, arresting hundreds of people

00:03:41.154 --> 00:03:43.089
Israel answered a barrage of rockets

00:03:43.089 --> 00:03:44.624
fired from Lebanon in Gaza

00:03:44.624 --> 00:03:45.858
with airstrikes.

00:03:45.858 --> 00:03:47.460
And even this weekend, things

00:03:47.460 --> 00:03:48.895
didn't stop.

00:03:49.128 --> 00:03:50.663
Israeli warplanes and drones

00:03:50.663 --> 00:03:52.498
bombed positions in Syria

00:03:52.498 --> 00:03:54.267
after several rockets were fired

00:03:54.267 --> 00:03:54.667
from there

00:03:54.667 --> 00:03:55.768
towards the Israeli

00:03:55.768 --> 00:03:57.770
occupied Golan Heights

00:03:57.770 --> 00:03:59.505
along long

00:03:59.505 --> 00:04:00.206
And Monday,

00:04:00.206 --> 00:04:01.608
the Israeli military shot

00:04:01.608 --> 00:04:03.509
and killed a 15 year old boy,

00:04:03.509 --> 00:04:05.545
Mohammed Fayez Bohan,

00:04:05.545 --> 00:04:07.146
in another part of the West Bank.

00:04:07.146 --> 00:04:09.182
The Palestinian Ministry of Health says

00:04:11.117 --> 00:04:12.051
They shot him in the

00:04:12.051 --> 00:04:13.853
head during the raid.

00:04:13.853 --> 00:04:15.755
What will happen to us?

00:04:15.755 --> 00:04:16.956
What is going to happen

00:04:16.956 --> 00:04:19.892
to our Palestinian people?

00:04:19.892 --> 00:04:20.793
The Israelis say

00:04:20.793 --> 00:04:22.095
their forces were attacked

00:04:22.095 --> 00:04:23.363
during an anti-terror

00:04:23.363 --> 00:04:25.431
raid in the village back

00:04:25.431 --> 00:04:26.933
near the abandoned settlement.

00:04:26.933 --> 00:04:28.835
Palestinians who say they own

00:04:28.835 --> 00:04:29.402
this land

00:04:29.402 --> 00:04:31.504
confronted Israeli security forces

00:04:31.704 --> 00:04:33.373
as the settlers were marching,

00:04:33.373 --> 00:04:35.742
vowing to build even more outposts

00:04:35.942 --> 00:04:38.111
with high members of Israel's government

00:04:38.244 --> 00:04:39.646
backing their quest.

00:04:39.646 --> 00:04:40.913
Despite the risk of further

00:04:40.913 --> 00:04:42.515
inflaming a country

00:04:42.515 --> 00:04:46.119
and a region already on the brink,

00:04:46.185 --> 00:04:47.086
as you can see, it's

00:04:47.086 --> 00:04:48.421
an extremely volatile

00:04:48.421 --> 00:04:50.156
situation here on the ground.

00:04:50.156 --> 00:04:50.657
And certainly

00:04:50.657 --> 00:04:52.158
there is a lot of concern internationally

00:04:52.158 --> 00:04:53.793
that all this could spiral

00:04:53.793 --> 00:04:55.295
into an even worse place.

00:04:55.295 --> 00:04:56.362
And if you look at those clashes

00:04:56.362 --> 00:04:57.297
that took place today

00:04:57.297 --> 00:04:59.132
near that march where we were.

00:04:59.132 --> 00:05:00.066
The Palestinian authorities

00:05:00.066 --> 00:05:00.900
are now saying

00:05:00.900 --> 00:05:02.602
that more than 200 people

00:05:02.602 --> 00:05:04.304
were injured in those clashes.

00:05:04.304 --> 00:05:06.506
So obviously the violence continues

00:05:06.506 --> 00:05:07.140
and there certainly

00:05:07.140 --> 00:05:08.441
is the danger that that violence

00:05:08.441 --> 00:05:09.676
could get worse. Isa?

00:05:09.676 --> 00:05:09.976
Yeah,

00:05:09.976 --> 00:05:10.710
and it's not just

00:05:10.710 --> 00:05:11.778
the violence continuing.

00:05:11.778 --> 00:05:13.112
Tragedy comes with it

00:05:13.112 --> 00:05:13.846
because the mother,

00:05:13.846 --> 00:05:14.647
of course,

00:05:14.647 --> 00:05:15.181
of the two

00:05:15.181 --> 00:05:17.350
British Israeli sisters were killed

00:05:17.350 --> 00:05:17.984
in that shooting

00:05:17.984 --> 00:05:18.351
in the West

00:05:18.351 --> 00:05:19.185
Bank on Friday,

00:05:19.185 --> 00:05:21.954
we believe has died of her injuries.

00:05:22.021 --> 00:05:23.189
Just remind us, Fred,

00:05:23.189 --> 00:05:24.390
of what happened here

00:05:26.125 --> 00:05:26.926
Yes, certainly that was

00:05:26.926 --> 00:05:28.594
one of those incidents on Friday.

00:05:28.594 --> 00:05:28.828
Friday,

00:05:28.828 --> 00:05:30.897
of course, was extremely violent day

00:05:30.897 --> 00:05:31.764
here on the ground.

00:05:31.764 --> 00:05:32.732
We had a ramming attack

00:05:32.732 --> 00:05:34.500
that took place in the evening

00:05:34.500 --> 00:05:35.101
in Tel Aviv.

00:05:35.101 --> 00:05:36.669
But earlier in the West Bank,

00:05:36.669 --> 00:05:38.071
there was a shooting incident

00:05:38.071 --> 00:05:39.405
where a car received

00:05:39.405 --> 00:05:41.441
a bullet shot or gunshots

00:05:41.841 --> 00:05:43.009
with a family in it.

00:05:43.009 --> 00:05:43.710
It was a mother

00:05:43.710 --> 00:05:44.043
and her

00:05:44.043 --> 00:05:44.844
two daughters

00:05:44.844 --> 00:05:46.979
and the two daughters were killed

00:05:46.979 --> 00:05:47.914
in that crash.

00:05:47.914 --> 00:05:49.415
They were pronounced dead at the scene.

00:05:49.415 --> 00:05:50.116
And the word

00:05:50.116 --> 00:05:51.050
at that point in time

00:05:51.050 --> 00:05:53.252
was that the mother had survived

00:05:53.252 --> 00:05:55.188
but was in very grave condition.

00:05:55.188 --> 00:05:57.924
Now, she has also succumbed to her

00:05:57.924 --> 00:05:58.191
wounds.

00:05:58.191 --> 00:06:00.093
Her funeral is set for tomorrow,

00:06:00.093 --> 00:06:00.727
as you say.

00:06:00.727 --> 00:06:00.960
And that,

00:06:00.960 --> 00:06:01.427
of course,

00:06:01.427 --> 00:06:02.128
is something

00:06:02.128 --> 00:06:03.663
that is extremely emotional,

00:06:03.663 --> 00:06:05.264
not just for the family,

00:06:05.264 --> 00:06:07.100
but also for this entire country.

00:06:07.100 --> 00:06:08.267
In fact, the eulogy,

00:06:08.267 --> 00:06:08.801
the service

00:06:08.801 --> 00:06:09.769
for the two daughters were something

00:06:09.769 --> 00:06:11.838
that was broadcast here on national TV.

00:06:11.938 --> 00:06:13.439
And certainly we expect the same thing

00:06:13.439 --> 00:06:14.807
to happen tomorrow as well.

00:06:14.807 --> 00:06:15.341
So certainly

00:06:15.341 --> 00:06:16.376
another thing

00:06:16.376 --> 00:06:17.443
that really

00:06:17.810 --> 00:06:19.946
inflames tensions here on the ground

00:06:19.946 --> 00:06:21.180
is, as we can see,

00:06:21.180 --> 00:06:22.648
it certainly shows no signs of this

00:06:22.648 --> 00:06:24.817
calming down anytime soon Isa.

00:06:24.817 --> 00:06:25.752
Fred Pleitgen for us

00:06:25.752 --> 00:06:27.053
this hour in Jerusalem.

00:06:27.053 --> 00:06:28.054
Thanks very much, Fred.

